hadiths[26]{hadithnumber,text}:
"613","(65) Gharar aur us ke ilawa mana ki gayi be'on ka bab: Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Uqbah - ya'ni Ibn Khalid - ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ubaydullah - ya'ni Ibn Umar - ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne gharar ki be' se aur hasah (kankari wali) ki be' se mana farmaya."
"614","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Ishaq ibn Isa al-Tabba' ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Malik ne khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne habal al-habalah ki be' se mana farmaya."
"615","Ibn al-Muqri aur Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne do be'on se aur do libason se mana farmaya, to rahi do be'en to mulamasah aur munabadhah hain, aur rahe do libas to ishtimal al-samma' aur ek hi kapde me ehtiba karna jabke us ki sharmgah par us me se kuch na ho."
"616","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Rawh ibn Ubadah ne bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Sayyar se, al-Sha'bi se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: kankari phenk kar be' na karo, aur najsh na karo, aur mulamasah ke zariye be' na karo, aur tum me se jo muhaffalah (thanon me doodh rok kar rakha hua janwar) khareede phir use napasand kare to use wapas kar de, aur us ke sath ek sa' khana (ghalla) bhi wapas kare."
"617","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Amr se, unhon ne Abu al-Minhal ko kehte hue suna: main ne Iyas ibn Abd al-Muzani ko kehte hue suna: pani mat becho, kyunke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko pani ki be' se mana farmate hue suna, main nahin janta woh kaun sa pani hai, aur Sufyan ne ek dusri martaba kaha: unhen Abu al-Minhal ne khabar di."
"618","Mahmud ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Waki' ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne fazil (zaid) pani ki be' se mana farmaya."
"619","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Zinad se, al-A'raj se, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: fazil pani ko is liye na roka jaye ke us ke zariye ghaas (kala) ko roka jaye, Sufyan ne kaha: aur teen cheezen hain jinhen nahin roka jata: pani, ghaas aur aag."
"620","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne bayan kiya, Humayd al-A'raj se, Sulayman ibn Atiq se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne salon tak phal ki be' se mana farmaya."
"621","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abu al-Nu'man aur Musaddad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu al-Zubayr aur Sa'id ibn Mina se, Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma se ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne muhaqalah aur muzabanah aur mukhabarah aur mu'awamah se mana farmaya, aur dusre ne kaha: salon ki be' (se), aur thunya (istisna) se (mana farmaya), aur arayah me rukhsat di."
"622","Hasan ibn Arafah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hushaym ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Yunus ibn Ubayd ne khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: maal-dar ka tal-matol karna zulm hai, aur jab tumhen kisi maal-dar par hawalah diya jaye to us ke peeche jao, aur ek (saude) me do be'en na becho."
"623","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ne bayan kiya, Muhammad se, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abu Salamah ne bayan kiya, Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se: ke Aap ne ek be' me do be'on se mana farmaya."
"624","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya ke Isma'il ibn Ulayyah ne unhen khabar di, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se Amr ibn Shu'ayb ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, yahan tak ke unhon ne Abdullah ibn Amr Raziallahu anhuma ka zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: qarz aur be' (ka ikattha hona) halal nahin, aur na be' me do sharten, aur na us cheez ka nafa' jis ki zamin na li gayi ho, aur na us cheez ki be' jo tumhare paas na ho."
"625","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'adh ibn Fadalah al-Tufawi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ya'la - woh Ibn Hakim hain - se, unhon ne kaha: Yusuf ibn Mahak ne mujh se hadees bayan ki, Abdullah ibn Ismah se, Hakim ibn Hizam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main ek aisa aadmi hun jo khareed o farokht ke liye khareedta hai, to un me se kya halal hai aur kya haram hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae mere bhai ke bete, jab tum koi sauda khareedo to use us waqt tak na becho jab tak tum us par qabza na kar lo."
"626","Aur isi tarah Shayban aur Hammam ne kaha, Yahya se, Ya'la se, Yusuf se, Abdullah ibn Ismah se, Hakim se. Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se ise bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, Shayban se."
"627","Aur Abu Ja'far al-Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habban ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya."
"628","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Salim se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne phal ko bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ka pakna zahir ho jaye."
"629","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Anas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khajoor ke darakhton ka bechna durust nahin hai yahan tak ke us ka pakna zahir ho jaye, unhon ne kaha: Aur us ka pakna kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh surkh aur zard ho jayen."
"630","Ali ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isma'il - yani Ibn Ulayyah - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne khajoor ke darakhton ko bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh zahw ho jayen, aur baliyon ko yahan tak ke woh safed ho jayen aur aafat se mehfooz ho jayen, Aap ne bechne wale aur khareedne wale dono ko mana farmaya."
"631","Ibn al-Muqri ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Woh cheez jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya woh khana hai ke use becha jaye yahan tak ke us par qabza kar liya jaye. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Aur main har cheez ko isi ke misl hi samajhta hun."
"632","Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Numayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Hum sawaaron se khana andaze se (juzafan) khareeda karte the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein mana farmaya ke hum use bechen yahan tak ke hum use us ki jagah se naqal kar len."
"633","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Jabir ibn Abdillah Raziallahu anhuma ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne khajoor ke dher ko, jis ka naap ma'lum na ho, muqarrar naap ki khajoor ke badle bechne se mana farmaya."
"634","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ma'mar ne humein khabar di, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne janwar ko janwar ke badle udhaar par bechne se mana farmaya."
"635","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shihab - yani Ibn Abbad - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud - yani al-Attar - ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke janwar ko janwar ke badle udhaar par becha jaye."
"636","Ali ibn Khashram ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah Raziallahu anhu se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne janwar ko janwar ke badle udhaar par bechne se mana farmaya."
"637","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, Anas Raziallahu anhu se: ke Safiyyah Dihyah al-Kalbi ke hisse me aayin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne unhen saat saron ke badle khareed liya."
"638","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Zubayr se, Jabir Raziallahu anhu se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne ek ghulam ko do siyah ghulamon ke badle khareeda."
